  "full_text": "Mr. God, could you address stability in a Lamarck biological inheritance model? Is this stability? From the time it goes forth, it shall take you, for morning by morning shall it pass over, by day and by night, and it shall be a vexation only to understand the report. For the bed is shorter than that a man can stretch himself on it, and the covering narrower. then he can wrap himself in it for the lord shall rise up as in mount per person and he shall be wroth as in the valley of gibeon that he may do his work this strange work and bring it to pass his act his strange act now therefore be not markers lest your bands be made strong for i have heard from the lord god of host consumption of consumption even determined upon the whole earth Hey, no, no, don't do it, don't do it. Give you ear and hear my voice hearken, hear my speech. Does the plowman plow all day to sow? Does he open and break the clouds to the ground? When he hath made plain the face thereof, does he not cast abroad the pitches and scatter the cumin and cast in the principal wheat and the appointed barley and the rye in their place? For as God has us instruct to describe... Fuck you, I'm recording, asshole. I'm sorry, I thought you were... Did you see the fucking camera? I saw it. Fuck you. I thought you were King Terry. Yeah, I'm fine. Okay, okay, okay, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry. It's okay, I just wanted to... I thought you were just some bum trying to get a cigarette and I'm recording it. No, you're quite alright. Okay. I watched your video, so I just wanted to say have a good day. Okay, sorry about that. You too. Okay, bye.",
